  "title": "Calendar Feeds: Subscription Addresses, Export and Import | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "Calendar Feeds let Outlook, Google Calendar and phones follow an Orchard Core calendar through a private subscription address, and let you export a calendar as an .ics file or import one. Re-importing a file updates events by their identifier instead of adding them twice.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why feeds: a subscription address, and calendar files\n• Making, copying, replacing and removing the subscription address\n• Private events show as busy time\n• Exporting a calendar as an .ics file\n• Importing an .ics file, and importing it again",
